  "Soldered LED board resting on my hand": "Placa de LEDs soldada, apoyada en mi mano",
  "Starting the design": "Empezando el diseño",
  "Storyboarding": "Storyboard",
  "Suited up inside a race car": "Con el mono puesto dentro de un coche de carreras",
  "Sunset over the beach back home": "Atardecer en la playa de casa",
  "Swim meet athlete accreditations": "Acreditaciones de atleta en un campeonato de natación",
  "Swimming medals hanging on the wall": "Medallas de natación colgadas en la pared",
  "Takeaways & Reflections": "Conclusiones y reflexiones",
  "Task 1: Browsing": "Tarea 1: Explorar",
  "Task 2: Cart Review": "Tarea 2: Revisar el carrito",
  "Task 2: Customization": "Tarea 2: Personalizar",
  "Task 3: Checkout": "Tarea 3: Pago",
